ation of Speed & Energy**\n\n1. **Coefficient of Fluctuation of Speed ($C_s$):** The ratio of the maximum fluctuation of speed to the mean speed.\n   $C_s = \\frac{N_{max} - N_{min}}{N_{mean}}$\n2. **Coefficient of Fluctuation of Energy ($C_E$):** The ratio of the maximum fluctuation of energy to the total work done per cycle.\n   $C_E = \\frac{\\Delta E}{\\text{Work done per cycle}}$","thinking":"**Revisiting the Prompt**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the core request: reintegrating the diagrams and algebraic components into the \"cheat sheet.\" The focus is on a comprehensive, self-contained output, eliminating the need for external references.\n\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
